    "summary": "將照片處理成 3:4 直式海報，上半部保留原始照片氛圍與真實質感，下半部由 AI 將核心輪廓重構為極簡幾何拓印與雜誌排版。",
    "prompt_text": "Vertical 3:4 modern editorial poster with split composition. The upper half faithfully preserves the original photo's mood, texture, and natural subject: {subject}. The lower half reinterprets the core silhouette and emotional memory of the scene into minimalist geometric shapes, risograph block print, textured paper collage, and elegant line art. Exhibition poster aesthetic, Swiss typography layout, artistic contrast between realism and abstraction.",
    "markdown_body": "## Prompt 提示詞\n\n```text\nVertical 3:4 modern editorial poster with split composition. The upper half faithfully preserves the original photo's mood, texture, and natural subject: {subject}. The lower half reinterprets the core silhouette and emotional memory of the scene into minimalist geometric shapes, risograph block print, textured paper collage, and elegant line art. Exhibition poster aesthetic, Swiss typography layout, artistic contrast between realism and abstraction.\n```\n\n## 創作原理與適配建議\n\n- **核心視覺手法**：\n  - **上下二元對話**：打破一般照片濾鏡的常規思維，上半部保留紀實攝影的「真實溫度」，下半部透過符號化抽取，展現「記憶沈澱後的抽象形態」。\n  - **瑞士風格排版 (Swiss Style Typography)**：在分割處加入極簡網格線、座標或文字標籤，增添展覽海報的當代藝術氣息。\n- **最佳推薦題材**：\n  - **人像攝影**（如京都和服少女）：下半部能優雅抽取髮髻輪廓與衣褶幾何線條。\n  - **建築與室內**（如台中魚麗書店、摩天樓）：空間透視線自然轉化為下方的包浩斯幾何構成。\n  - **街頭紀實**（如香港夜行、富士山馬拉松）：動態身影化為俐落的剪影符號。\n- **應用小提醒**：\n  - 若遇微距特寫或低對比風景，可於 Prompt 中加重主體描寫（如「emphasize the distinct contour of...」），避免下半部幾何化過於發散。",
